{"3209950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MARINES VS GOD", "steam_appid": 3209950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Add the game to your Wishlist to support the developers!</h1><p>ㅤ</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/22d4217b87918ad67b30343ddc7ceaac.poster.avif?t=1787038150\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/22d4217b87918ad67b30343ddc7ceaac.webm?t=1787038150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/22d4217b87918ad67b30343ddc7ceaac.mp4?t=1787038150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the year 2400, Earth's scientists discovered the &quot;Planets of Gods&quot;—worlds filled with unimaginable treasures lying just beneath your feet. But each planet is guarded by a mighty Guardian God. Only the bravest dare join the Marines for a short and dangerous landing mission on one of these planets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/1575df68d82cd0b8b1d336b521c577ba.avif?t=1787038150\" width=800 height=128 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/6492c0839c08cae4cf7e4e68e881edfc.poster.avif?t=1787038150\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/6492c0839c08cae4cf7e4e68e881edfc.webm?t=1787038150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/6492c0839c08cae4cf7e4e68e881edfc.mp4?t=1787038150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Marines' Objective:</strong><br>Gather as many divine treasures as possible, survive the relentless attacks of the God—including hordes of monsters, traps, and devastating cataclysms—and evacuate the planet alive.<br><br><strong>God's Objective:</strong><br>Destroy the Marines by strategically choosing the best spells, wisely managing mana, setting traps, summoning creatures, and controlling the elements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/62c5cdfcde59e58e64fc65bbc6ccd795.avif?t=1787038150\" width=800 height=128 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/fa2442a1eee42292df4cfe036ef1eeb5.webp?t=1787038150\" width=24 height=24 /></span> <strong>Zombie Summon</strong> — attacks nearby Marines.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/3b5b72475438d54f4332cf795b2d6b03.webp?t=1787038150\" width=24 height=24 /></span> <strong>Psionic Storm</strong> — deals lightning damage over an area.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/d5f905e2b7489c836a70b6c80369b20c.webp?t=1787038150\" width=24 height=24 /></span> <strong>Illusion of Doubles</strong> — creates deceptive duplicates.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/7b551eed8a54c4047df06595af552473.webp?t=1787038150\" width=24 height=24 /></span> <strong>Fireball</strong> — deals massive damage after a short delay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/24b13c9b2dc53c10e6cd57feebd29b31.webp?t=1787038150\" width=24 height=24 /></span> <strong>Stone Barrier</strong> — creates a wall at the chosen location.<br><br><strong>And many more!</strong><br><i>Each spell reshapes the battlefield—adapt your tactics to match your playstyle!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/346443da32cccc4d38ee8845dc7edbbb.avif?t=1787038150\" width=800 height=128 /></span><br><br><strong>Each planet is unique and full of secrets:</strong><br>• Martian Wastelands<br>• City of the Future<br>• Jungle Labyrinth<br>• Ice Fortress<br>• Abandoned Civilization<br><br><strong>Choose Your God:</strong><br>Zeus, Demon Lord, Anar Dreams<br><br><strong>Choose Your Marine:</strong><br>Defender, Sniper, Medic, or Engineer<br><br><strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong><br>Classic asymmetric mode (4vs1)—God versus the Marines squad.<br>PvP, PvE, cooperative, and mixed modes with friends or against AI (up to 8 players).", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/22d4217b87918ad67b30343ddc7ceaac.poster.avif?t=1787038150\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/22d4217b87918ad67b30343ddc7ceaac.webm?t=1787038150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/22d4217b87918ad67b30343ddc7ceaac.mp4?t=1787038150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the year 2400, Earth's scientists discovered the &quot;Planets of Gods&quot;—worlds filled with unimaginable treasures lying just beneath your feet. But each planet is guarded by a mighty Guardian God. Only the bravest dare join the Marines for a short and dangerous landing mis